    },
    {
      "text": "路线选择与强力神器共同塑造每局策略，并形成不同协同",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose your path wisely and wield powerful artifacts that shape your strategy, presenting intriguing synergies along the way.",
